WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
[Deep sub bass: BP01 Concrete Breath]
Fifty basslines.

2
00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:03.700
Built for the basement.

3
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.450
[Kick drum enters]
Sparse. Rolling. Offbeat. Syncopated.
Staccato. Sustained. Acid. 50 patterns.

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.200
[Rolling bass: BP11 Marrow]
Every note is in the file.
Real MIDI loops of 1, 2, or 4 bars, with tempo and key in each one.

5
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.950
700 notes. 50 MIDI files. 7 groove families.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.850
[Acid bass with slides: BP44 Acid Rain]
Validated like software.

7
00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:18.700
12 of 12 checks pass.

8
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.600
A second parser agrees on all 700 notes.

9
00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:22.450
Byte-identical on every rebuild.

10
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.350
[Acid build: BP50 Last Call]
Audition every file in your browser.

11
00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:26.200
Then drag the .mid into your DAW.

12
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.100
[Riser builds]
Free. Royalty-free in your own tracks.

13
00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:30.000
[Final bass hit]
Basement Protocol. 50 free bassline MIDI files.
